  <p>Each cup buys a shorter lift while the edge keeps climbing. By mid-afternoon, you have more edge than energy.</p>
  <p>That is why the 2 PM slump feels so familiar. The thing you use to escape the crash keeps setting up the next one.</p>
  <p>I was not looking for another energy drink with a cleaner label.</p>
  <p class="beat">I was looking for a different pattern.</p>

  <h2>I was not looking for stronger coffee. I was looking for a different range.</h2>
  <p>Kratom comes from <em>Mitragyna speciosa</em>, a tree in the coffee family that grows in Southeast Asia.</p>

